{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CO","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"哥林多前书","commonName":"哥林多前书","title":"哥林多前书","order":46,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"58721c4c81e84430fff62a1b233e41a608284b0b851fb9a8d469702bd1c5623e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CO/16.json","totalNumberOfVerses":437},"chapter":{"number":5,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["判断淫乱的事件"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["风闻在你们中间有淫乱的事。这样的淫乱连外邦人中也没有，就是有人收了他的继母。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["你们还是自高自大，并不哀痛，把行这事的人从你们中间赶出去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我身子虽不在你们那里，心却在你们那里，好像我亲自与你们同在，已经判断了行这事的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["就是你们聚会的时候，我的心也同在。奉我们主耶稣的名，并用我们主耶稣的权能，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["要把这样的人交给撒但，败坏他的肉体，使他的灵魂在主耶稣的日子可以得救。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["你们这自夸是不好的。岂不知一点面酵能使全团发起来吗？"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["你们既是无酵的面，应当把旧酵除净，好使你们成为新团；因为我们逾越节的羔羊基督已经被杀献祭了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["所以，我们守这节不可用旧酵，也不可用恶毒",{"noteId":1},"、邪恶的酵，只用诚实真正的无酵饼。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我先前写信给你们说，不可与淫乱的人相交。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["此话不是指这世上一概行淫乱的，或贪婪的，勒索的，或拜偶像的；若是这样，你们除非离开世界方可。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["但如今我写信给你们说，若有称为弟兄是行淫乱的，或贪婪的，或拜偶像的，或辱骂的，或醉酒的，或勒索的，这样的人不可与他相交，就是与他吃饭都不可。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["因为审判教外的人与我何干？教内的人岂不是你们审判的吗？"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["至于外人有 神审判他们。你们应当把那恶人从你们中间赶出去。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":1,"caller":"-","text":"或译：阴毒","reference":{"chapter":5,"verse":8}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CO/5.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CO/6.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CO/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}